  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Task Order 16 - Disability Incusive HAMRO COFFEE - Expanding Opportunities for Small Scale Farmers with Disabilities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Men and women with disabilities whose livelihoods could benefit from engagement with the coffee value chain</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project under the UK funded DID programme with Light for the World as Task Order Management Organisation, and partnering with ICCO and NFDN. Project to create an inclusive coffee value chain model in Nepal, from coffee sapling nurseries through to point of consumption.</narrative>
  </description>
